Some of them are building hybrid orderbooks, intent-based execution, modular risk engines, and AI-assisted trading, which could give them a huge edge as liquidity grows.

The market is shifting from cex to multi-chain, low-fee, low-latency perp trading this is where these new players shine.

And early adoption here could be the equivalent of being early on Hyperliquid in 2023 or Lighter in 2024.

